// Force the old monolithic google.golang.org/genproto to a version that no
// longer contains googleapis/api or googleapis/rpc subdirectories. Those
// packages now live in the split modules genproto/googleapis/api and
// genproto/googleapis/rpc. Without this replace, the workspace merges the
// old monolithic version (pulled in transitively by censor/aliyun) with the
// split versions (used by lock/etcd), causing "ambiguous import" errors.
replace google.golang.org/genproto => google.golang.org/genproto v0.0.0-20260319201613-d00831a3d3e7
